posts.text:
Elon has nearly 160,000 direct employees throughout his companies and supports almost 870,000 jobs. 

Over five years, based on conservative estimates, @elonmusk’s companies have injected $338 billion into the US economy. 

@Tesla makes the first and second most American made cars. 

@SpaceX made the first fully reusable rocket and the world’s largest satellite internet constellation. 

As Axios says: his “companies are central to America's technological and military power.”

In the end, the only people the Democrats will hurt are the American people.

